Interatomic potentials -- linked, never mirrored
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Checkpoints are downloaded by the user and pinned by URL and SHA-256 in
harness/config.py. None is mirrored in this repository; models/ is gitignored.

  MACE-MP-0 medium          code MIT,  checkpoint MIT
  MACE-MPA-0 medium         code MIT,  checkpoint MIT   (production engine)
  SevenNet-Omni             code MIT,  checkpoint MIT
  eSEN-30M-OAM              code MIT,  checkpoint under the OMat24 licence;
                            gated on Hugging Face and requires accepting terms.
                            It must stay linked and never mirrored -- the gate
                            exists so each user accepts those terms.

