Dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Nothing third-party is vendored into this repository; dependencies are resolved
by the user's package manager from uv.lock. All are permissive except ASE
(LGPL-2.1-or-later), which this repository declares as a dependency and does not
distribute. See reports/licensing.md section 2 for what changes if a future
product ever bundles ASE.
